{
  "_comment": [
    "Explicit SQLite -> MySQL native-type mapping for prisma/schema.prisma.",
    "Prisma maps `String` to VARCHAR(191) on MySQL. Every field that can exceed",
    "191 characters MUST be listed here or production data is silently rejected",
    "(strict mode) or truncated (non-strict mode).",
    "Fields used in @id / @unique / @@index / @@unique intentionally stay",
    "VARCHAR(191) so they remain indexable under InnoDB key-length limits.",
    "LongText = potentially unbounded documents/LLM payloads (4 GiB).",
    "Text      = long but bounded free text / small JSON blobs (64 KiB)."
